  mocks). State that they must be (re)produced by running the code-generation command above —
  never hand-written or hand-edited — and point at the source files whose change triggers
  the regeneration.
- **Verification** — the concrete steps/commands that prove the change works.

If something is ambiguous and blocks planning, use the `<plan_qa>` form instead — but prefer
to ship a plan if you can make a reasonable assumption and call it out explicitly in the plan
itself.

